  The reel_script and caption say the special gram sabha meetings in all Karur district panchayats were held on the same subject ('இதே போன்ற' / 'இதே தலைப்பில்'), but the article only says the Vetri Veedu special gram sabha meetings were held in all panchayats, not that the same beneficiary-list approval was done in each.
  The reel_script says the meeting was held at the panchayat office, which matches the article, but the slides_spec line 'கிருஷ்ணராயபுரம் யூனியனில் திருக்காம்புலியூர் பஞ்சாயத்தில்' is an incomplete sentence with no clear meaning or verb, and the slide line is cut mid-phrase.
  The caption says the Thirukkampuliyur meeting was held at the panchayat complex and that the final beneficiary list was approved there; the article supports this, but the reel_script omits who attended the Thirukkampuliyur meeting (panchayat secretary Rajaratnam and office staff) while the caption and slides mix this with the Kathapparai officials, blending two separate meetings' facts into one sentence in the slides ('பஞ்சாயத்து செயலாளர் ராஜரத்தினம் மற்றும் அலுவலக பணியாளர்கள்' listed under the Kathapparai officials slide), which the article attributes to the Thirukkampuliyur meeting.
